                                        "entry_id": "5bf27c41-5d99-3176-bb77-94ba021a265c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Causing offense; arousing a visceral reaction of disgust, anger, hatred, sadness, or indignation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "377f34ab-1dce-47e8-b32e-c98be8064d09",
                                                "sense_id": "bb56e515-69fe-3c17-9e98-e02334352389",
                                                "text": "Some people find pornography offensive."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b83971eb-e2eb-4444-a710-b346a26d8705",
                                                "sense_id": "bb56e515-69fe-3c17-9e98-e02334352389",
                                                "text": "An offensive smell."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "956db94e-a36b-4bbb-909c-80d5267fc573",
                                                "sense_id": "bb56e515-69fe-3c17-9e98-e02334352389",
                                                "text": "A survey at Yale University had 63% of students wanting professors to issue “trigger warnings” before saying anything that some might find offensive or could cause painful emotions."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cb2c18d-4ffb-427d-ba77-109968c66929",
                                                "sense_id": "bb56e515-69fe-3c17-9e98-e02334352389",
                                                "text": "Britain’s police are especially zealous. Officers spend thousands of hours sifting through potentially offensive posts and arrest 30 people a day. Among those collared were a man who ranted about immigration on Facebook and a couple who criticised their daughter’s primary school."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "62177d67-d740-3090-8829-00aa5508a485",
                                        "entry_id": "5bf27c41-5d99-3176-bb77-94ba021a265c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Relating to an offense or attack, as opposed to defensive."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8816a25a-d511-4a04-997e-20acf7b4ba4f",
                                                "sense_id": "62177d67-d740-3090-8829-00aa5508a485",
                                                "text": "The army's offensive capabilities. An offensive weapon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "78c385b0-c487-4204-863a-dd6e6f3146f3",
                                                "sense_id": "62177d67-d740-3090-8829-00aa5508a485",
                                                "text": "In his submission to the UN, [Christof] Heyns points to the experience of drones. Unmanned aerial vehicles were intended initially only for surveillance, and their use for offensive purposes was prohibited, yet once strategists realised their perceived advantages as a means of carrying out targeted killings, all objections were swept out of the way."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "31b27cbf-1bbc-3dd0-8762-0dd51cc5ffb2",
                                        "entry_id": "5bf27c41-5d99-3176-bb77-94ba021a265c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Having to do with play directed at scoring."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a0205613-dae3-4550-9bab-0d48b955be18",
                                                "sense_id": "31b27cbf-1bbc-3dd0-8762-0dd51cc5ffb2",
                                                "text": "The offensive coordinator is responsible for ordering all rushing plays."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
